SPDX License List identifier data
=================================

The identifier and deprecation tables in src/spdx_catalog/identifiers.mbt
are adapted from SPDX License List 3.29.0 as distributed in the Apache-2.0
licensed EmbarkStudios/spdx 0.13.6 file src/identifiers.rs:
https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/spdx/blob/0ca398c29698ee46c9d2497569817aebde53feaf/src/identifiers.rs

Moon License Scan normalizes and reorders the license and exception
identifiers and retains their deprecation flags. The table does not
include license texts from the upstream source.

